This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Shard b of adversarial-shard-merge runs units xs, fi and fg: the shipped merge in place over worlds this file builds itself (the merge resolves its siblings from its own path, MERGE_SELF), a golden beside this file, and FI's 9 mutants on copies of the merge's directory. A consumer runs the shipped shards a, c and d, which locate the merge, the remediation-guard hook, the rulebook, the provenance schema and wait-for-deliverable in either layout and drive them in place.
